    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7863.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Edle, Ehrenveste, Fromme, Fürsichtige, Ersame
<lb n="2"/>Wyse, innsonders günstige Herren, guotte Fründ,
<lb n="3"/>getrüwe lieb Eydt- und pundtsgnossen, Eüch seÿge
<lb n="4"/>unser fründtlich gruoß, mit erbietung aller
<lb n="5"/>ehren, liebs und guots, bevor.
<lb n="6"/>Demnach füegendt wir E. V. Ehrv. F. E. W. zuoer-
<lb n="7"/>nemmen, daß uff hüt den tag seines datums, allß
<lb n="8"/>wir rhatßwÿß beÿ einanderen versampt gewesen,
<lb n="9"/>für unß kommen und erschinen ist, der ehrenvest,
<lb n="10"/>und wÿß unser getrüwer lieber mitrhat, unnd
<lb n="11"/>alter statthogt <persName resp="#ner">Cuonradt Krauß</persName>, allß ehevogt
<lb n="12"/>eüwerer gewesnen burgerin, frawen <persName resp="#ner">Helena
<lb n="13"/>Lagin</persName>, an statt und in nammen derselben, und klagt-
<lb n="14"/>wÿß fürbringen lassen, allß uff absterben ihres
<lb n="15"/>vor disem gehabten lieben ehewürths <persName resp="#ner">Gerhart
<lb n="16"/>Groben</persName> seeligen zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-33" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Liechtensteig</placeName>, sie mit ihren
<lb n="17"/>beeden ihro vor disem zuogeordneten vögten,
<lb n="18"/>nahmens <persName resp="#ner">Heinrich Spießer</persName> und <persName resp="#ner">Ruodolph Groben</persName>,
<lb n="19"/>wegen erstgedachts ihres ehewürths, und dessen
<lb n="20"/>geliebten vatters <persName resp="#ner">Lux Groben</persName> seeligen ver-
<lb n="21"/>lassenschafft, an dem appellation gricht zuo be-
<lb n="22"/>meldtem <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-33" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Liechtensteig</placeName> in rechtfertigung erwach-
<lb n="23"/>sen; Daß neülich daselbsten von herren appel-
<lb n="24"/>lation richter und seinen beÿsitzeren ein söliche
<lb n="25"/>unrechtmessige und hochbeschwerliche urtel wider
<lb n="26"/>sie gesprochen und ußgefelt worden seige, beÿ
<lb n="27"/>deren ein jeder, so der sachen beschaffenheit nur
<lb n="28"/>ein geringe wüssenschafft habe, handtgrifflich zuo-
<lb n="29"/>verspüren seige, daß eintweders ein merckliche
<lb n="30"/>partheÿlichkeit, oder sonsten ein privat affect,
<lb n="31"/>wegen der religion, mit under geloffen sein müße.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7864.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/>Dann obgleich woll <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besagte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>: <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Helena</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Tigin</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnd</unclear>-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erchschidenlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mahlen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sowoll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innes</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstens</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">knecht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> bemelte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vögt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-33" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Liechtenstaig</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gert</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unpartheyischen</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biderbsleueten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innemens</unclear> und außgebens
<lb n="37"/>raittung, und sölche rechnung geben lassend, da-
<lb n="38"/>mit man in specie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuesen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möge</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear>, wie und
<lb n="39"/>wohin sye daß seinig verwennedt, welches aber
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inme</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wieder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alles</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgeschlagen</unclear> worden.
<lb n="41"/>Zuo deme auch so seye sye <placeName resp="#ner">Eberschweileren</placeName> dahin
<lb n="42"/>gehalten worden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwecher</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwager</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">viell</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unrichtige</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungich</unclear>-
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tige</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbkandtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schulden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">namblich</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bandtlin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gmoosern</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-141" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vznach</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehr</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezalen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müessen</unclear>.
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derowegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diemuetflechigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölltend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ers</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. mit disem
<lb n="49"/>schreiben früendtlcihen, Eydt- und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtsgnössischs</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuechen</unclear>, dieselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wölltend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füerderung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">justitien</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehenlichen</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesandtschaft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bei</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollicitieren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhalten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselbig</unclear> per decretum besagte
<lb n="54"/>beede vögt dahin halte und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermöge</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inbeweederers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Helena</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Tigin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwandten</unclear>,
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biderbleüeten</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechnung</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raittung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebendt</unclear>.
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nuen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear> nit können
<lb n="59"/>abschlagen noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwaiggeren</unclear>.
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gelangt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demnach</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ers</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ganz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früendtlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydt</unclear>- und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pundtsgnössigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselben</unclear> wöllend besagten supplicanten in
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7865.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">großguenstig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willfahren</unclear>, und
<lb n="64"/>denselben, darzue sye guot fuog und recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habend</unclear>,
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befüerersam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wehr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mögendt</unclear>.
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solchs</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichen</unclear> und mehreren
<lb n="68"/>hinwiderumb guettwillig zubeschulden und
<lb n="69"/>zuuerdienen.
<lb n="70"/>Göttlicher bewahrung unß beiderseits woll
<lb n="71"/>befehlend. Datum den <origDate when="1618-06-16" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">6</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">16</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Juny</unclear>. Anno 1618</origDate>.
<lb n="72"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Stattuogt und Rhatt
<lb n="73"/>zuo Mayenfeldt</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2098_7866.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="74"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Edlen</unclear>, Frommen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vesten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fuersichtigen</unclear>, Ersamen
<lb n="75"/>und Weyßen herrn <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rhat
<lb n="76"/>der Statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>. Meinen Innsonnders
<lb n="77"/>günstigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrewen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fürdrern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="78"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">patronen</unclear>.
<lb n="79"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanct</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName>.
</p>
